{
  "name": "@fish-under-sea/dsh-git-sync",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "description": "DeepSeek Harness 一键 GitHub 同步：把插件清单、插件启用状态、插件配置、本地设置、Skills、Skill 的 refs/脚本、看板/用量账本、设置导航顺序偏好与壁纸引擎设置采集进你自己的私有 git 仓库并推送，换机可一键还原；采集前自动 fetch 远端并合并，密钥永不搬运。0.2.5 起不再同步 agent 预设 / 桌宠存档 / 工作区映射，0.2.6 起不再同步归档台账，0.2.7 起纳入 skill-refs，0.3.0 起支持额外扫描根（壁纸引擎的 config.json 与玻璃预设，取自 ~/.dsh-wallpaper-engine）。仓库目录在「设置 → Git 同步」里改。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "sync",
    "git",
    "backup",
    "github"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/Fish-under-sea/dsh-fish.git",
    "directory": "packages/dsh-git-sync"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "engines": {
      "dsh": ">=0.2.0-rc.2"
    },
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}